    <!-- Help screen -->
    <string name="help_title">How the walk works</string>
    <string name="help_intro">The Bruff Heritage Trail is a self-guided walk of four historic sites in Bruff, Co. Limerick — about 90 minutes at a relaxed pace.</string>
    <string name="help_section_getting_started_title">Getting started</string>
    <string name="help_section_getting_started_body">You need to be in Bruff to begin. If you\'re not there yet, the app shows how far away you are and returns to the home screen after a few seconds — just reopen it once you\'ve arrived.</string>
    <string name="help_section_start_title">While you\'re in Bruff</string>
    <string name="help_section_start_body">Once you\'re in the area, tap Start the walk. The map shows the route to the first stop.</string>
    <string name="help_section_route_title">Following the route</string>
    <string name="help_section_route_body">• The gold line connects all four stops in order — that\'s your route for the whole walk.\n• The arrow and distance at the bottom of the screen always point to your next stop.</string>
    <string name="help_section_arrival_title">Arriving at a stop</string>
    <string name="help_section_arrival_body">When you\'re close enough your phone buzzes, shows a notification, and a card appears with an Explore this stop button. Open it to read the site\'s history, then tap Continue for the next stop. If you walk on without continuing, the app offers to move you along.</string>
    <string name="help_section_map_title">Reading the map</string>
    <string name="help_section_map_body">• Gold marker — the stop you\'re heading to (it flashes)\n• Faded gold marker — stops still ahead\n• Green marker with a check — a stop you\'ve visited</string>
    <string name="help_section_tips_title">Tips</string>
    <string name="help_section_tips_body">• The screen stays on automatically while you\'re navigating.\n• The GPS badge in the corner shows your location accuracy.\n• If you wander outside Bruff mid-walk, you\'ll get a reminder to head back.</string>
</resources>
